    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/5ecda6a77ec2971229c255011fbb9959.poster.avif?t=1753379522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/5ecda6a77ec2971229c255011fbb9959.webm?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/5ecda6a77ec2971229c255011fbb9959.mp4?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game about a girl who just wants to forever clear her city of crime. To do this, she will have to go a long way from *mad cosplayer*, chasing dirty perverts out of the park, to the real super hero fighting against evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/46db079f67c0b33c9fea1ed82a85aecb.poster.avif?t=1753379522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/46db079f67c0b33c9fea1ed82a85aecb.webm?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/46db079f67c0b33c9fea1ed82a85aecb.mp4?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfortunately, her father did not leave her a billion-dollar company, so she would have to be a hero, working as an office secretary at the same time, or earning money in some other way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/9289fff34f86209053a89b1477c40d5d.poster.avif?t=1753379522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/9289fff34f86209053a89b1477c40d5d.webm?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/9289fff34f86209053a89b1477c40d5d.mp4?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you will help her in all this. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to help her in the battle against crime... <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/a96870cbd10e935c8b49a4c0324c466e.poster.avif?t=1753379522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/a96870cbd10e935c8b49a4c0324c466e.webm?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/a96870cbd10e935c8b49a4c0324c466e.mp4?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In battles against overweight... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/9cde71b7c282954a5b313c87efff24e7.poster.avif?t=1753379522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/9cde71b7c282954a5b313c87efff24e7.webm?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/9cde71b7c282954a5b313c87efff24e7.mp4?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And help her in relationships with her colleagues.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/cdadc70d5398045143869e5e6e8484ad.poster.avif?t=1753379522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/cdadc70d5398045143869e5e6e8484ad.webm?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/cdadc70d5398045143869e5e6e8484ad.mp4?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Girl-superhero management sim with RPG and tycoon elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hilarious storyline where you will see the backstory of the main heroine </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Card battles (or beatemup mechanic) with the crime! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Train your hero! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TONS</strong> of Awesome arts (more than <strong>100 </strong>animated scenes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>12+ </strong>hours of gameplay for fast walkthough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/a53b5628853d3d9a63b09e42180e6fde.poster.avif?t=1753379522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/a53b5628853d3d9a63b09e42180e6fde.webm?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129520/extras/a53b5628853d3d9a63b09e42180e6fde.mp4?t=1753379522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
